### 3. PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "posisi": "Senior UI/UX Designer",
  "gaji": 7000000
}


### 4. DELETE 
DELETE {{baseUrl}}


### 5. POST - Menguji validasi data
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "posisi": "AB",
  "perusahaan": "A",
  "lokasi": "B",
  "tipe": "Freelance",
  "gaji": -1000000,
  "deskripsi": "Pendek"
}


### 6. GET - Menguji NotFoundException
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/999


